1
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,140
YAMU!

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,000
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,558
You're on the move!

4
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:03,560
Nice win, Joey.

5
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,037
You made it to round two.

6
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:07,520
And I owe Duke a stake. Oh, well.

7
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:09,770
Attention!

8
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,940
The next two bouts will now begin!

9
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:15,501
Hurry up, guys, or we're
gonna miss the next duel!

10
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:21,380
In lock B, we have regional champ
and self-proclaimed child genius,

11
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,300
Rebecca Hocknins!

12
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:26,417
Check it out!

13
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:31,480
She'll face the
model-turned-actress-turned-kong-fu-master-turned-duelist,

14
00:01:31,740 --> 00:01:32,800
Vivian Wong!

15
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:34,680
Not her!

16
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,860
I'm telling you, that diva
is nothing but bad news!

17
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,310
Ha-ha!

18
00:01:39,393 --> 00:01:42,600
Yes, it's another duel I
can't get enough! Let's go!

19
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:44,837
I guess someone's excited to be here.

20
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:49,237
I know you like dueling, but if you don't
calm down, you're gonna hurt yourself.

21
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:51,837
It's been so long since
I've been near the action.

22
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,420
I just gotta...

23
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:56,290
Grandpa!

24
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,330
Told ya.

25
00:01:57,860 --> 00:01:59,560
Grandpa, are you okay?

26
00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:04,140
Ah, it appears he's thrown his back out.

27
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,220
Aw, poor guy.

28
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:06,872
I'll radio for a doctor.

29
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,680
Just relax, Grandpa.

30
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,220
Yuki, don't worry about me.

31
00:02:12,380 --> 00:02:15,837
You just go with your friends and
enjoy the rest of the tournament.

32
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:18,540
But I can't leave you like this. Go on.

33
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,818
I shall look after your grandfather.

34
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,760
You go and root for Rebecca.

35
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,257
But are you sure, Professor?

36
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:26,760
My granddaughter would never admit it,

37
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:29,684
but she could really use
some support out there.

38
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:36,460
Oh, that's the last time I eat
bean burritos before a duel.

39
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,360
He's are kicking in.

40
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,660
Are you sure this is gonna work?

41
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,640
Stop being so negative, Rex!

42
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:46,660
Name the last time one
of my ideas did work!

43
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:52,340
Every time, just once, I'd like to get
my revenge without looking like a doofus!

44
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:55,520
Oy, stadium food.

45
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,780
Hey, that's mine!

46
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:05,480
So much for not looking like a fool.

47
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,525
Shut up and keep your balance.

48
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:12,160
I still have to go to the bathroom.

49
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:16,280
This duel's gonna be really
short and really lame.

50
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:17,620
Kinda like you.

51
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:20,517
I was hoping for a real opponent,

52
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:25,997
not someone who needs mommy's permission
to duel someone strong like yugi he's so

53
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:32,017
commanding yet sweet and gentle all at the
same time look viv you won't be stepping

54
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:38,377
within 50 feet of my yugi so give it up
oh is that so trust me when i ace this

55
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:40,537
tournament and become
a celebrity yugi will

56
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:44,640
forget all about you i bet he already has

57
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:49,280
Aw, you're gonna tell
teacher I'm picking on you?

58
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,760
Alright, let's go, Half-Pint Bring it on

59
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:14,020
It's time to duel

60
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:21,237
I'll go first You'll need a head start

61
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:26,140
I summon Kung Fu Nian Nian in attack mode

62
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:34,160
Top that, shrimp No problem, look out
Time to activate a little magic card

63
00:04:35,060 --> 00:04:38,277
Graceful Charity Now I
get to draw three new

64
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:41,140
cards As long as I
discard two from my hand

65
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:46,640
Next I think I'll summon my
fire princess in attack mode

66
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:53,500
Then I'll place two cards
face down That'll do for now

67
00:04:54,940 --> 00:04:59,440
Check it out, guys I found
it Yo, Beck, how's it going?

68
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,550
Yugi!

69
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:06,960
Hi, Yugi-poo I knew you'd be here
to cheer me on, my little dumpling

70
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,740
Not quite!

71
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:11,157
Yugi's here for me!

72
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,317
Don't worry, Pumpkin!

73
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:16,282
As soon as I trounce this little
twerp, it's all about you and me!

74
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,700
Aw, man!

75
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,095
You're my hero, Yugi!

76
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,680
So what's your secret?

77
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,540
Uh, natural charm!

78
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:26,077
Oh, this is why I need
more female friends!

79
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,513
Show no mercy, Rebecca!

80
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,620
That glamazon has gotta go!

81
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:32,240
So, you ready to dance?

82
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:34,618
Uh, I don't dance with preschoolers.

83
00:05:35,340 --> 00:05:38,860
Now, where was I? Oh, yeah. I remember.

84
00:05:39,100 --> 00:05:43,571
I was about to kick your puny butt back
to the playpen with my Kung Fu Nian.

85
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:48,460
Who, by the way, gets 300 extra
points thanks to her special ability.

86
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:52,900
But first, I summon my Master
Kianshi in attack mode.

87
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:59,360
And now, it's time to
extinguish your Fire Princess.

88
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:04,857
In your dreams, Fiv,
I reveal my trap card.

89
00:06:04,940 --> 00:06:07,999
It's a little something I
like to call gravity bind.

90
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,957
As long as it's on the field,

91
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:14,040
you can't attack me with any monster
that has more than three stars.

92
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,070
No!

93
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:22,446
That little brat's gonna pay.

94
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:24,425
No one makes a fool out of me.

95
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,700
This duel's far from done.

96
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,300
Well, so far, so good. I guess.

97
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:31,997
But Rebecca's trap card
affects her own monsters, too.

98
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:35,315
If they have more than three
stars, she can't use them.

99
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,620
That's not good.

100
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:40,309
I'm sure that this is
all part of her plan.

101
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,020
She'll be just fine.

102
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:45,100
Get a load of this.

103
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,090
First,

104
00:06:47,173 --> 00:06:51,460
I'm activating Marie the Fallen One's
special ability from the card graveyard.

105
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:58,417
Now I automatically receive
200 extra life points

106
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:01,500
for every turn that Marie
remains in the graveyard.

107
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:07,846
And to finish things off, I'll activate
the special ability of my Fire Princess.

108
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:12,480
So every time my life points
increase, yours increase by 500.

109
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,860
I knew it. Awesome!

110
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:20,237
Rebecca's three-card combo allows her to

111
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:23,379
automatically lower Vivian's
life points every turn.

112
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:27,500
I'll place one card face
down, and that'll do it.

113
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,477
So, Viv, tell me how it feels.

114
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:32,340
You know, to lose to a preschooler.

115
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:39,473
Everything seems to be running smoothly.

116
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,440
But that's what worries me.

117
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:46,779
I would have expected my little
hacker friend to strike again by now.

118
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:51,240
Unless he's already in Kaivaland.

119
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:55,197
Roland, run a background
check of every competitor.

120
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,160
Is that understood? Yes, sir.

121
00:07:57,720 --> 00:08:00,380
Until then, everyone is a suspect.

122
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:05,780
All right, I'm through going easy on you.

123
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:10,140
It's go time now, so wipe
that smile off your face.

124
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:13,600
Or else I will. Look out!

125
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,960
There appears to be some
nasty weather up ahead.

126
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:22,737
You're not scared of a
little rain, are you, kid?

127
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:27,240
Because I activate the magic
card, Mystical Space Typhoon!

128
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:28,890
Tough break.

129
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:30,680
Now your trap goes bye-bye.

130
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,540
Later, Gravity Bind.

131
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:35,360
Oh, no!

132
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:38,758
Now Vivian can attack with
all her powerful monsters!

133
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,280
Activate Face Down card!

134
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:43,120
Imperial Order!

135
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:49,040
As long as this trap remains on my side of
the field, your magic cards are useless!

136
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:51,317
That brat did it again!

137
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:54,500
Now I play the magic card, Scapegoat!

138
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:03,360
Oh well, I guess your storm blew over.

139
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,400
Hold on.

140
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,424
Why didn't Scapegoat disappear?

141
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:11,437
That's because she drew Scapegoat
first but played it last and then...

142
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:12,350
No clue.

143
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,080
It's simple, guys.

144
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:16,797
The last card played in a
turn always activates first,

145
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:20,397
so the first card has no effect on the
last even though it was played first.

146
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:23,140
Wait, so last is first? Right!

147
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:27,752
And since Rebecca used scapegoat last,
it was unaffected by Imperial Order!

148
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:30,100
Come on, man. It's simple.

149
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:33,161
Then perhaps you'd like
to explain it to me again.

150
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,440
Okay, twerp.

151
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:36,340
Playtime's over. Sure,

152
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,617
you may have stopped me
from playing any of my magic

153
00:09:38,700 --> 00:09:41,557
cards or any monster that
has more than three stars,

154
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:42,820
but watch this!

155
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:46,460
You can't stop me from
playing Gaku-ji-rei Panda!

156
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:53,860
And now to activate his special power.

157
00:09:54,220 --> 00:10:00,020
For every monster you have on the field,
my cuddly panda gains 500 extra points.

158
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:05,920
Whoa, now it's got over
3,000 attack points.

159
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,060
What's wrong?

160
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,917
You don't have any hidden
trap cards to stop me?

161
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,840
Now, my panda, attack her
scapegoat with Kung Pao Paw!

162
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:19,930
Ha!

163
00:10:20,013 --> 00:10:24,057
And since my panda's attack points are
greater than your scapegoat's defense points,

164
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:26,537
the difference comes
out of your life points.

165
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:28,855
One more attack, and you're bear bait.

166
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:34,300
What's wrong, Beck?

167
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:37,177
You got the sniffles because
my panda scratched out

168
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:40,197
most of your life points
with one swipe of his paw?

169
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,340
Aw, how sad.

170
00:10:42,140 --> 00:10:44,300
Please, you think I care? No!

171
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,630
Huh.

172
00:10:46,713 --> 00:10:49,040
It's not like you can do
anything. Guess again.

173
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:52,100
First, I'll free up my magic cards. Huh?

174
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:55,860
You know what happens next, right?

175
00:10:56,180 --> 00:10:58,320
I collect my 200 life points.

176
00:10:59,140 --> 00:11:00,020
Oh, yeah.

177
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:04,438
Don't forget about the 500 points
you lose thanks to my fire princess.

178
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,497
You're really starting to
bug me, you little runt.

179
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:11,920
How sad.

180
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:18,200
If you don't like that, well, then you're
gonna hate this token thanksgiving.

181
00:11:19,020 --> 00:11:21,677
Sure, it destroys my three
remaining scapegoats,

182
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:24,860
but it gives me an extra
800 points for each one.

183
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:32,080
Oh, and since I just got stronger,

184
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:35,481
my fire princess takes a
few more points from you.

185
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:38,580
Hold on.

186
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:41,745
I've got one more little
surprise for you, Viv.

187
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,500
Injection Fairy Lily!

188
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:54,040
Now I sacrifice 2,000 of my life
points to make Lily stronger.

189
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:00,740
Attack her overstuffed teddy bear!

190
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,580
Oh, yeah.

191
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,040
The Beck is back.

192
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:10,180
So the first card's last.

193
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:12,105
Then the last card goes first.

194
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:13,220
I'm still lost.

195
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,680
I end my turn.

196
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,670
Okay.

197
00:12:16,753 --> 00:12:17,583
Last chance.

198
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:20,280
I'll start off with this.

199
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:23,840
It's a handy little magic
card called Luminous Clouds.

200
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:29,857
This gives me the power to
sacrifice my Kung Fu Nian Nian

201
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:34,660
along with my Master Kian Shi
in order to summon Dragon Lady.

202
00:12:37,900 --> 00:12:40,020
She can't attack with that thing.

203
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,380
Dragon Lady's a seven-star monster.

204
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:45,800
That's strange. I know. What's she up to?

205
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:47,680
Bad news, Junior.

206
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:50,700
Every turn that my Dragon
Lady doesn't attack,

207
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:54,740
she automatically destroys one
of your magic or trap cards.

208
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:02,040
Next, I'll activate my
Mystic Eruption card.

209
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:03,570
Now,

210
00:13:03,653 --> 00:13:09,460
any player who lost a magic or trap card
this turn also loses 1,000 life points.

211
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,160
Rebecca, no! Aw, man.

212
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:17,087
Her life points are back
in the gutter again.

213
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:21,380
So, short stuff, see what happens
when you party with the big girls?

214
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:24,597
Maybe you'd have better luck
playing a game of Go Fish.

215
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:27,517
But I think the funniest
part of this whole duel is

216
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:30,659
that you actually thought
Yugi came here to see you.

217
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,120
Oh, like he came here to see you?

218
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:39,212
If I were about to lose this
duel, I wouldn't be laughing.

219
00:13:40,060 --> 00:13:41,960
This is where it all ends, Viv.

220
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:44,180
For you, that is my move.

221
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:48,892
The first thing I'll do is collect my
200 points from my good friend Marie.

222
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:54,840
And let's not forget the 500 points
you lose thanks to my fire princess.

223
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,657
You're still no match for
my dragon lady, Shrimp.

224
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:04,017
Then I guess I'll just have to sacrifice
my two monsters to play this card.

225
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:07,000
It's my guardian angel,
Joan, in attack mode.

226
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:20,100
And since you already got rid of my gravity
vine, guardian angel's able to attack.

227
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:21,170
Hold on.

228
00:14:21,253 --> 00:14:24,997
Even if you destroy my dragon lady,
I'll still have some points left.

229
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,880
Trust me, I've done the math.

230
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,826
That's why I'm activating
my Silent Doom card!

231
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:36,064
This magic card lets me bring one monster
back from the graveyard in defense mode!

232
00:14:36,380 --> 00:14:38,800
And I choose Fire Princess!

233
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,980
Not her again!

234
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,960
Yep, I'm afraid so!

235
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:46,960
Now, Guardian Angel,
attack her Dragon Lady!

236
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:54,540
There's only one thing left to do!

237
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:59,700
And that's activate Joe's power,
giving my life points a boost.

238
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:05,200
Of course, that in turn activates
the power of my fire princess,

239
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:07,968
causing you to lose the
rest of your points.

240
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,910
Great.

241
00:15:12,993 --> 00:15:14,058
Way to go, Rebecca.

242
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,180
That was awesome.

243
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:16,180
Thanks, Taya.

244
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,400
We knew you'd pull through.

245
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,820
Smoothie! I'm right!

246
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,560
No one comes between us, Viv.

247
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,280
We'll just see.

248
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:32,660
Hey, check it out.

249
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,840
The other match just ended, too.

250
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:41,320
And according to Kaiba's chart, Joey's
gonna duel against whoever wins this match.

251
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,500
Look, it's that pink-haired freak.

252
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:50,080
Siegfried Lloyd will
now face Fortune Solis.

253
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:55,837
You know, Weevil, I'm the one who should
be dueling in this match, not you!

254
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:56,750
What?

255
00:15:56,833 --> 00:15:58,480
My insect duck is way better!

256
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,960
Hey, quit stepping on my ear!

257
00:16:06,180 --> 00:16:07,900
Huh? Those two?

258
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,900
What are they doing here?

259
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:11,957
Acting like complete numbskulls.

260
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,220
What else? Hey!

261
00:16:13,420 --> 00:16:14,477
Nice job, Spaz!

262
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:16,240
You're the Spaz! You are!

263
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,630
Hey!

264
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:20,857
What'd you guys do with
the real fortune, Selene?

265
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:26,140
Uh, well, you might say he's tied up right
now, so he asked me and Rex to fill in.

266
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,110
Right, Rex?

267
00:16:27,193 --> 00:16:28,300
Uh, that's right.

268
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,697
He thought we would best fill his shoes.

269
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:31,610
Yeah, right.

270
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:36,300
Nice try, but no one can duel
unless they're registered. No fair!

271
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:38,320
Just let the boys duel.

272
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:44,680
After all, I did wear my favorite suit,
and I look too good just to win by forfeit.

273
00:16:45,820 --> 00:16:46,780
I can't.

274
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:49,097
Think of your business, Herr Mokuba.

275
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:52,820
You wouldn't want to disappoint
your public now, would you?

276
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,460
So let me duel these two fools.

277
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:57,520
Who you calling a fool? Yeah,

278
00:16:57,740 --> 00:17:00,797
we're not the ones with the pink
hair and outdated leisure suit,

279
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:02,697
so watch who you're calling a fool,

280
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:03,610
fool!

281
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:07,380
I hope you're watching, Herr Kaiba,

282
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:11,880
because I have a special
show in store just for you.

283
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:16,980
I don't trust this guy.

284
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:21,520
It's time to duel!

285
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:29,740
Alright, punk! My move!

286
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:33,600
And I'll start by summoning
my Pinkhopper in attack mode!

287
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:36,620
Then I'll activate this!

288
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,100
My aerosol!

289
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:45,840
It exterminates my insect!

290
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,037
And now the real fun can begin!

291
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,580
Once my Pinchhopper's in the graveyard,

292
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:54,680
its special ability lets me
summon any insect monster I want.

293
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:58,060
And I choose the mightiest
of them all, Insect Queen!

294
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:03,200
Alright, now my partner's
gonna get prehistoric on you!

295
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:05,160
Well put.

296
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:09,380
And now, I summon Balloon
Lizard in attack mode!

297
00:18:11,020 --> 00:18:14,160
Then I'll use this card, Ultra Evolution.

298
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:19,380
Now all I have to do is
sacrifice my lizard friend!

299
00:18:19,620 --> 00:18:22,940
That allows me to summon any
dinosaur card that I want!

300
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:24,780
Meet Black Tyreno!

301
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,740
I'd like to see you get
past my Jurassic giant!

302
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,517
And even if you do, you won't stand a
chance against my incredible insect!

303
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:44,160
We'll see about that, boys.

304
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,350
Ah.

305
00:18:46,433 --> 00:18:47,263
What are you smiling at?

306
00:18:47,346 --> 00:18:50,360
It's gotta be bluffing, Weevil! It's time.

307
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:53,080
My conquest has already begun to blossom.

308
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:57,340
Now I shall harvest my victory with this.

309
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,780
Ride of the Valkyries!

310
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,510
Behold!

311
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:06,540
The most dazzling
creatures in Duel Monsters!

312
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,960
And also the most dangerous!

313
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,440
Hey, what's going on?

314
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:27,280
Where's my insect queen and my tyranny?

315
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:37,640
Weevil, tell me that didn't just happen.

316
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,372
That didn't just happen.

317
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:50,260
The winner of this bout after
only one turn is Siegfried Lloyd!
